ES — Código visible, no libre

El código de Rumbo se publica para que se pueda leer, estudiar y valorar.
Sin permiso previo y por escrito del autor NO se permite:

  1. Modificar el código ni publicar versiones derivadas.
  2. Copiar, redistribuir o volver a publicar el código, entero o en parte.
  3. Sublicenciarlo, venderlo o usarlo con fines comerciales.
  4. Enviar contribuciones (pull requests) que no hayan sido pedidas o
     aceptadas antes por el autor.

Se permite, sin pedir permiso:

  - Ver el código y descargarlo para leerlo.
  - Compilar y usar la app sin modificar, para uso personal y no comercial.
  - Abrir issues para avisar de errores o proponer ideas.

Para pedir permiso: abre un issue en el repositorio o escribe al autor.

EN — Source available, not open source

The source code of Rumbo is published so it can be read, studied and
evaluated. Without the author's prior written permission you may NOT:

  1. Modify the code or publish derivative works.
  2. Copy, redistribute or republish the code, in whole or in part.
  3. Sublicense, sell or use it for commercial purposes.
  4. Submit contributions (pull requests) not previously requested or
     approved by the author.

You may, without asking:

  - View the code and download it to read it.
  - Build and use the unmodified app for personal, non-commercial use.
  - Open issues to report bugs or suggest ideas.

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR
OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE USE OF THE SOFTWARE.
